                                                "sense_id": "fe8004d2-d81e-3a2c-af6e-911f7af8830c",
                                                "text": "Sucking up all you can / Sucking up all you can suck and suck / Working up under my patience like a little tick / Fat little parasite (parasite) / Suck me dry / My fruit is bruised and borrowed / You thieving bastards / You have turned my blood cold and bitter"
